          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Conceptual variable with a substantive value domain specified.
:title: "DDI-CDI Represented Variable"
:idDescription: "Identifier for this RepresentedVariable node"
:rdfType: ``cdi:RepresentedVariable``</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifRepresentedVariable.RepresentedVariable"/>
